{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_vrtx_011qRy1EsGQXdinig7WM6RP5","type":"tool_result","content":"rick tools provides a set of validation and management commands for Rick workflows.\n\nThese commands are primarily used by AI agents during the learning phase.\nAn AI agent reads 'rick tools --help' to discover all available tools,\nthen decides which commands to invoke to complete its work.\n\nAvailable subcommands:\n  plan_check      Validate the plan directory structure for a job\n  doing_check     Validate the doing directory structure for a job\n  easy_check      Validate the doing directory for an easy mode job (debug/ only)\n  learning_check  Validate the learning directory structure for a job\n  dream_check     Validate dream_run_{job_id}_log.md files in .rick/dream/\n\nUsage:\n  rick tools [flags]\n  rick tools [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  doing_check    Validate the doing directory structure for a job\n  dream_check    Validate dream_run_{job_id}_log.md files in .rick/dream/\n  easy_check     Validate the doing directory structure for an easy mode job\n  learning_check Validate the learning directory structure for a job\n  plan_check     Validate the plan directory structure for a job\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help   help for tools\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --dry-run      Run in dry-run mode without making changes\n      --job string   Specify job ID (e.g., job_1)\n  -v, --verbose      Enable verbose output\n\nUse \"rick tools [command] --help\" for more information about a command.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7e5456ea-02c5-46f8-8fd1-06e69709f61b","uuid":"9e4f22a6-147c-484e-9203-8d46936a0d09","timestamp":"2026-06-26T12:57:52.995Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"rick tools provides a set of validation and management commands for Rick workflows.\n\nThese commands are primarily used by AI agents during the learning phase.\nAn AI agent reads 'rick tools --help' to discover all available tools,\nthen decides which commands to invoke to complete its work.\n\nAvailable subcommands:\n  plan_check      Validate the plan directory structure for a job\n  doing_check     Validate the doing directory structure for a job\n  easy_check      Validate the doing directory for an easy mode job (debug/ only)\n  learning_check  Validate the learning directory structure for a job\n  dream_check     Validate dream_run_{job_id}_log.md files in .rick/dream/\n\nUsage:\n  rick tools [flags]\n  rick tools [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  doing_check    Validate the doing directory structure for a job\n  dream_check    Validate dream_run_{job_id}_log.md files in .rick/dream/\n  easy_check     Validate the doing directory structure for an easy mode job\n  learning_check Validate the learning directory structure for a job\n  plan_check     Validate the plan directory structure for a job\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help   help for tools\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --dry-run      Run in dry-run mode without making changes\n      --job string   Specify job ID (e.g., job_1)\n  -v, --verbose      Enable verbose output\n\nUse \"rick tools [command] --help\" for more information about a command.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
